<title>NETHERLANDS: VNU details first-half operating profits.</title>
<headline>VNU details first-half operating profits.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publisher VNU gave the following breakdown of its first-half results:</p>
<p>				    H1 1996		 H1 1995</p>
<p>				Sales  Op profit    Sales  Op profit</p>
<p> Consumer magazines	 618     90	    568	80</p>
<p> Newspapers		   363     49	    295	46</p>
<p> Commercial TV		127	6 loss     174	33 profit</p>
<p> Business info Europe     231     24	    178	18</p>
<p> Business info USA	  382     61	    362	41</p>
<p> Education		     42	6	     36	 3</p>
<p> Miscellaneous charges    ---     16	    ---	30</p>
<p>NOTES - Sales and operating profit are given in millions of guilders. Commercial TV includes pro rata share of sales and operating profits in Dutch group HMG and Belgium's VTM.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
